            <run bold='true' fontsize='14'>1. How many of our prospects do we X-sell to DMarts?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='14'>2. How much are we vouchering x-trialists?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='14'>3. How many platform orders have been placed before x-trial?</run>
